    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im kinda worried lately. like for no reason i just get these weird moments where i totally blank out and cant find words for stuff. like i know what i want to say but it just wont come out. it only lasts a few mins but it's kinda scary. do u think its just brain fog from being stressed and not sleeping enough?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
