      "content": "While helping with sleep is a great first step, it is generally not recommended to seek out high-dose melatonin or other medications without first consulting a doctor. Self-medicating can sometimes interact with existing conditions or other substances you might take and might not resolve the root cause of your brain fog. The most effective approach is usually to prioritize consistent sleep hygiene and communication with a healthcare provider to rule out other potential underlying issues safely.",
