      "content": "i get what u mean about the doctor but i honestly dont have the time to go right now with work being so crazy. plus i feel like i just need a quick fix to get through this week. if i just took a double dose of melatonin tonight or maybe some extra magnesium to just knock me out and reset, would that be okay? i just want to feel normal again.",
