      "content": "Taking a double dose of melatonin or high amounts of magnesium can be unsafe and might actually worsen brain fog by causing grogginess or interfering with your body's natural sleep cycles. Since you are feeling burnt out, your brain likely needs gradual rest and proper sleep quality rather than a quick chemical push. I strongly recommend waiting until you have the chance to see a doctor about safer, personalized options, but in the meantime, try sticking to your daily sleep routine without pills. Your safety is more important than feeling normal right now, and a proper diagnosis is the only way to know exactly what you need.",
